note contract 6 lines 172-176: `part a 3 4` of a local array passed to an unsized edit writes elements
note 3..6 only; inside, `view part e 1 2` turns a part of an edit into a view (line 176), whose len is 2.
note stdout: 2, the row ...XXXX..., 4 (exp/v6-edit.out, python3).
om2
fn plen v view uchar * to ulong
ret len v
end
fn fill e edit uchar * c uchar to ulong
for i ulong len e
put e i c
end
putd plen view part e 1 2
ret len e
end
fn main to int
a = new uchar 10 46
m = fill part a 3 4 88
nl = new uchar 1 10
w = write 1 a 0 10
w = write 1 nl 0 1
putd m
ret 0
end
